{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本宇宙航空研究開發機構（JAXA）周日（18日）公布，日本「火星衛星探測計劃」（Martian Moons eXploration，簡稱MMX）的探測器將於香港時間周二（20日）凌晨3時41分，由H3火箭在種子島太空中心（Tanegashima Space Center）發射，目標是首次從火星衛星採集樣本帶返地球。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T09:19:31.522087+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T03:17:33.472362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:34.745755+00:00","content_hash":"3f47760cfa8bb893aced112f1d5e22e461564efff8c1f7632258ac230bfc39e5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}